en-projection-software-for-churches-in-the-browser-eghudmarx","summary":"Reuna Presenter is a browser-based church presentation app built as a web alternative to ProPresenter and EasyWorship. Built with Next.js 15, React 19, Supabase, and TypeScript in a Turborepo monorepo, it supports multi-screen projection to congregation and stage monitors, a drag-and-drop service plan, a cloud-shared song library, Bible integration with offline support, mobile remote via QR code, MIDI timeline cues, and CSS container query-based templates. The solo developer is offering 10 days of PRO access to church tech teams willing to test it in a live Sunday service.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--JGKyt3TK--/f_auto/v1777299426/posts/6QQPHHRaz?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-30T20:06:56.674Z"},{"id":"Fm5AD6nci","title":"Nextjs guide lines","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/nextjs-guide-lines-fm5ad6nci","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-18T15:02:18.111Z"},{"id":"XNuSqqBCi","title":"Hi, I'm Mohi Uddin \u2014 Full-Stack Developer skilled in React, Next.js & Node.js. I build scalable SaaS/web apps. View my work: https://mohifullstack.dev. Happy to help!","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/hi-i-m-mohi-uddin-full-stack-developer-skilled-in-react-next-js-node-js-i-build-scalable-saas-xnusqqbci","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-17T10:42:32.973Z"},{"id":"pbuqq4RwX","title":"One small change reduced our API response time from~800ms to under 100ms.","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/one-small-change-reduced-our-api-response-time-from-800ms-to-under-100ms--pbuqq4rwx","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-15T23:43:35.109Z"},{"id":"X1OIhK3zv","title":"Understanding rate limiting","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/understanding-rate-limiting-x1oihk3zv","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-30T12:47:12.966Z"},{"id":"mc4g0u77R","title":"Image Optimization \u2014 the #1 reason sites are slow","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/image-optimization-the-1-reason-sites-are-slow-mc4g0u77r","summary":null,"image":null,"num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-03-30T12:45:01.475Z"},{"id":"xO8snelHK","title":"Cascader-shadcn: A simple Cascader component for Shadcn","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cascader-shadcn-a-simple-cascader-component-for-shadcn-xo8snelhk","summary":"Cascader-Shadcn is a new open-source cascading dropdown component built for Shadcn UI. It offers hierarchical menus with click or hover expansion, icon support, custom rendering, and per-option disabling. The component provides similar functionality to Ant Design and React Suite cascaders but in a lightweight, Shadcn-compatible package. A live demo and GitHub repository are available for developers to explore and integrate into their projects.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--MdIgi-N4--/f_auto/v1764819282/posts/GzxcM1s9H?_a=BAMAK+ZW0","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-12-06T11:01:20.950Z"},{"id":"3ggQs21c3","title":"Build modern marketing websites with Shadcn blocks","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/build-modern-marketing-websites-with-shadcn-blocks-3ggqs21c3","summary":"Tailark is a platform offering pre-built, responsive UI blocks based on Shadcn UI for creating marketing websites. It includes multiple themed collections (Pro for enterprise, Dusk for dark mode, Mist for Notion-inspired designs) along with snippets and documentation. The platform accelerates development by providing ready-to-use modular components that maintain consistency and professional quality across devices, eliminating the need to build marketing layouts from scratch.","image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-21T10:56:07.121Z"},{"id":"JaYMYRtKO","title":"Animate UI is an open-source library of animated React components designed to make building stylish, interactive interfaces easier.","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/animate-ui-is-an-open-source-library-of-animated-react-components-designed-to-make-building-stylish--jaymyrtko","summary":"Animate UI is an open-source library offering animated React components, primitives, and icons to help developers quickly add smooth, modern animations to their interfaces. Built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Motion, it provides ready-to-use building blocks that can be customized and integrated directly into projects, saving development time while ensuring consistent motion design.","image":null,"num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-21T10:45:15.555Z"}],"similar_handles":["nextaitool","proflead","strapi_io","shamundev","microsaasexamples"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","xai","hamelhusain","hwchase17","skirano"],"similar":[{"id":"e00b4499-9e40-4271-99c6-068a74910b4f","handle":"nextaitool","name":"Next AI Tool","is_squad":true,"x":-8.7236,"y":8.6017,"cluster_id":2,"posts_collected":80,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZKFJnCtH--/f_auto/v1727356536/squads/e00b4499-9e40-4271-99c6-068a74910b4f","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":4.779454,"median_upvotes":0.0,"author_present_share":1.0,"hype_score":0.00625,"avg_read_time":1.0375,"tag_diversity":1.0625},"top_tags_preview":[["ai",63],["machine-learning",15],["productivity",12]],"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-4.7059,10.0],"cadence_depth":[-1.5588,-9.1176],"hype_variety":[-0.6324,4.25],"title_style":[-5.8235,-5.5294]}},{"id":"837a3817-9e10-4b04-988e-affb8d110d24","handle":"proflead","name":"proflead","is_squad":true,"x":-9.1774,"y":8.8787,"cluster_id":2,"posts_collected":12,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--bVL-hyam--/f_auto/v1721402443/squads